      <title>Volvo No Longer Looks Like a Bargain for China Car Billionaire Li Shufu</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-19/volvo-needs-to-become-more-chinese-its-glory-days-are-in-the-past</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d145b0960e16536973e42909</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Li Shufu appeared to have snagged an unvarnished gem when the Chinese tycoon bought Volvo Car AB from Ford Motor Co. back in 2010. Unfortunately for him, the $1.8 billion purchase isn’t looking like such a bargain today. The century-old Swedish carmaker is losing money again and competition from Li’s compatriots is partly to blame.</description>
